    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "To add or subtract decimals, line up the decimal points so tenths are under tenths. 12.50 plus 35.75 is 48.25.\nFill empty places with zeros. 5 minus 2.35 is 5.00 minus 2.35, which is 2.65.\nDecimals are used in money, length and weight."
    }
